{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is Zerun?</strong><br>A shamanic initiation. A vision quest through a labyrinth of danger and meaning. You are not truly here \u2014 but what happens here echoes beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distorted vision. Distorted world.</strong><br>Enter the trial with a warped field of view. You see the world as if through a curved lens, a spiritual tunnel that hides more than it reveals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Maze is alive.</strong><br>Run, react, adapt. Traps shift. Paths vanish. Items must be earned \u2014 and nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you finish the rite?</strong><br>Collect the sacred relics. Survive the ordeal. Transcend.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3801360?t=1755690010","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801360/36048b2252c3438261ac95ce3aba947746328b95/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755690010","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801360/6460eaa6a232b4b56b3c6f67daffd529c1242477/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755690010","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801360/6460eaa6a232b4b56b3c6f67daffd529c1242477/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755690010","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is Zerun?</strong><br>A shamanic initiation. A vision quest through a labyrinth of danger and meaning. You are not truly here \u2014